r, policy key closure: stated bounds in TRACEABILITY.md\n113|  (spec-silent or sibling-input scope), each witnessed by a named\n114|  test.\n115|\n116|## Brief gap (handoff precondition 1)\n117|\n118|The brief carries no surface table, so there is no surface row to\n119|map. Coverage map substitute: the clause map in\n120|`internal/cloneplan/TRACEABILITY.md` maps every pinned clause to\n121|its production entries and named tests, and the conformance matrix\n122|(`TASK-260830-1jmmqn_conformance-matrix.md`) maps every gate to\n123|its entries, killer tests, and killed narrowings (143 narrowings +\n124|1 marked arm-delete + 1 control).\n125|\n126|## Validation (real exit codes)\n127|\n128|| Command | Exit | Evidence |\n129||---|---|---|\n130|| `go test -count=1 ./internal/cloneplan/` | 0 (49s) | `package.log` |\n131|| `go test -count=1 -cover ./internal/cloneplan/` | 0, 96.8% statements | `cover.log` |\n132|| `go test -count=1 ./...` (full configured suite, once) | 0, 46 packages ok | `full.log` |\n133|| `go test -count=3` (new constant tests + TestPlanConstants) | 0 (5s) | `determinism.log` |\n134|| `go vet ./internal/cloneplan/` | 0 | `vet.log` |\n135|| `GOOS=windows GOARCH=amd64 go vet ./...` | 0 | `winvet.log` |\n136|| `gofmt -l internal/cloneplan/` | 0, no files | `gofmt.log` |\n137|| Mutant battery, 145 rows, run 1 | 144 KILLED + control SURVIVED | `mut-run1-verdicts.txt`, `mut-logs-run1/` |\n138|| Mutant battery, 145 rows, run 2 | 144 KILLED + control SURVIVED | `mut-run2-verdicts.txt`, `mut-logs-run2/` |\n139|| Guard pristine pass | 0 | `guard-controls/guard-pristine.log` |\n140|| Guard copy-widen control (must redden) | 1, gate named | `guard-controls/guard-copy-widen.log` |\n141|| Guard two-case-switch control (must redden) | 1, gate named | `guard-controls/guard-two-case-switch.log` |\n142|| Guard decode copy-widen control (must redden) | 1, gate named | `guard-controls/guard-decode-copy-widen.log` |\n143|| Owner suites, candidate (6 pkgs) | 0 | `owners-cand