{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000ca99","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0d24d-9c2d-7841-a066-6ac00d915ab7"},"sequence":935,"recorded_at":1780531400001865,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"6722cf1c-e919-40c8-89ba-6768c67dec7c","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"6722cf1c-e919-40c8-89ba-6768c67dec7c","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"6722cf1c-e919-40c8-89ba-6768c67dec7c"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0d250-970e-78c0-a831-274303ddf720"},"task_id":"01a0d250-970e-78c0-a831-274303ddf720","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0d250-970e-78c0-a831-274303ddf720","chunk":"Read text file `.temp/TASK-260924-3n78rv/jmmqn-conformance.md`.\n(119 line(s) above)\n120|\n121|Base is trunk HEAD (`547ea28`); candidate is the uncommitted\n122|tree. The six reused owner packages are byte-identical between the\n123|two (171 files, hash-compared) and their suites are green on both,\n124|so no input class moved. Re-verified in rev4 (production files\n125|untouched since rev3: plans.go still\n126|`sha256:c2f7eb93506291635218beb49a589d8920bf32459d2906d73c9c3c74e311f02f`).\n127|\n128|| Package | Entry | Input classes through this leaf | Base | Candidate | Moved |\n129||---|---|---|---|---|---|\n130|| `internal/environ` | `DecodeStrictObject` | valid object docs; dup-member / trailing-data / non-object / surrogate-escape docs | green | green | none |\n131|| `internal/environ` | `StringLength` | ASCII + multibyte strings at every bound | green | green | none |\n132|| `internal/environ` | `CheckStringBounds` | in-bound; over-max / under-min; non-string JSON | green | green | none |\n133|| `internal/environ` | `CheckUint53Bounds` | in-bound uint53; fraction / exponent / string / 2^53 | green | green | none |\n134|| `internal/environ` | `CheckDigest` | valid sha256; malformed digests | green | green | none |\n135|| `internal/environ` | `CheckUUIDv7` | valid v7; v4 / malformed ids | green | green | none |\n136|| `internal/environ` | `CheckSortedUniqueStrings` | sorted-unique; unsorted / duplicated / over-count | green | green | none |\n137|| `internal/environ` | `CheckSortedUniqueDigests` | sorted-unique; unsorted / duplicated | green | green | none |\n138|| `internal/environ` | `CheckSemver` | valid SemVer; non-SemVer versions | green | green | none |\n139|| `internal/scalar` | `ParseDigest` | valid sha256; malformed digests | green | green | none |\n140|| `internal/scalar` | `ParseUUIDv7` | valid v7; malformed ids | green | green | none |\n141|| `internal/scalar` | `SHA256Digest` | canonical omit-self bytes | green | green | none |\n142|| `internal/canonicaljson` | `Canonicalize` | plan / manifest / row objects | green | green | none |\n143|| `internal/clonebundle` | `EncodeExtensions` | closed maps; bad keys / values | green | green | none |\n144|| `internal/clonebundle` | `CheckExtensionsClosed` | closed; open / nested-dup | green | green | none |\n145|| `internal/clonebundle` | `OmitSelfDigest` | member maps + self field; tampered claims | green | green | none |\n146|| `internal/clonebundle` | `DecodeWorkspaceBinding` | valid bindings; broken bindings | green | green | none |\n147|| `internal/clonebundle` | `ValidCaptureClass` | 9 classes; unknown / 10th | green | green | none |\n148|| `internal/sessadapter` | `DecodeTuple` | valid tuples; broken tuples | green | green | none |\n149|| `internal/sessadapter` | `DecodeResourceLimits` | valid limits; broken limits | green | green | none |\n150|| `internal/clonefidelity` | `ValidDisposition` | 7 dispositions; unknown | green | green | none |\n151|| `internal/clonefidelity` | `ValidReasonCode` | core + reverse-DNS; bad codes | green | green | none |\n152|| `internal/cloneplan` | `BuildProjectionPlan` | valid plan; every invalid class in the clause map | n/a (new) | green | none (new surface, no importer yet) |\n153|| `internal/cloneplan` | `DecodeProjectionPlan` | sealed plan; mutated / hand-built docs | n/a (new) | green | none |\n154|| `internal/cloneplan` | `BuildProjectedObjectManifest` | valid manifest; every invalid class | n/a (new) | green | none |\n155|| `internal/cloneplan` | `DecodeProjectedObjectManifest` | sealed manifest; mutated docs | n/a (new) | green | none |\n156|| `internal/cloneplan` | 5 vocabulary predicates | in-vocabulary; out-of-vocabulary incl. invalid UTF-8 | n/a (new) | green | none |\n157|\n158|## Axis inventory\n159|\n160|- Member census: 13 shapes, 97 members, reflection-derived from\n161|  the Go input types (nested structs, slices of structs, maps;\n162|  4 documented irregular names; synthesized members by sealed set\n163|  difference); per member: unknown/missing (decode), miscased in 6\n164|  variant classes (decode), 5-6 wrong JSON types (decode),\n165|  duplicated (decode, byte-path splicer), zero-value (build),\n166|  5 invalid-UTF-8 classes (both). Bounded: all axes enumerated\n167|  exhaustively. `TestMemberCensusNoLiteralList` guards the\n168|  derivation (trips at 10+ member names, 40%+ purity).\n169|- Identities: 2 ids; independent JCS recompute + wrong-omission\n170|  disagreement + tampered/non-digest refusals.\n171|- DAG: sequences unbounded above (uint53) — structural argument\n172|  (strict decrease forbids cycles; existence is a set lookup;\n173|  locality pinned by AST + 35 single-edge toggles) + every graph\n174|  through 4 ops (2+16+512+65536) vs the oracle through both\n175|  entries + every edge class at every 5-op position (30 probes) +\n176|  all 1024 valid 5-DAGs admit + targeted invalids\n177|  (higher/self/dangling/dup/unordered/non-contiguous).\n178|- Nullability: resources kind(2) x mode(3) x blob(2) = 12 cells\n179|  (full), entries kind(2) x 2^3 presence x mode(3) = 48 cells\n180|  (full), both entries, vs the oracle; every refuse cell asserts a\n181|  structural literal; the full entry grid additionally runs under\n182|  panic recovery.\n183|- Bounds: every length/count bound at min/max/min-1/max+1 with the\n184|  1M mapping edge sealed and decoded at both production entries;\n185|  mode/sequence/uint53 edges; multibyte character spot check.\n186|- Constants: gate list reflection-derived from the nested plan\n187|  input types (4 string, 7 closed boolean, 1 open boolean, modes)\n188|  plus the 4 decode-only schema/version literals, cross-checked\n189|  both directions against the spec oracle. Per string literal at\n190|  both entries: every edit-distance-1 neighbor over\n191|  lowercase+digit+underscore, every case variant class, a\n192|  fixed-seed 200-string sample, the `copy` second-value probe,\n193|  empty, and whitespace paddings; per boolean: the other boolean\n194|  both entries plus all 5 non-boolean JSON types at decode;\n195|  modes: per-element neighbor/case sweeps, order swap, lengths\n196|  0..4, non-string elements, non-array JSON. The single-literal\n197|  AST guard (`TestClosedConstantGateShape`) pins each gate to one\n198|  equality against the oracle literal: a second admitted value, a\n199|  switch, or a prefix/fold/contains call fails it (control-planted\n200|  with the reviewer's copy widening and a two-case switch, both\n201|  redden). The unbounded remainder past the generated set is\n202|  closed by the guard, not by sampling: any second value changes\n203|  the gate shape or the comparison-literal set.","final_result":true}}}
